From d639d5cd36e2591a7182ea912036d7c9db2abcf8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 07:02:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] lax/rational-functions: proofs build at v4.33.0

Nine files, thirteen sites: simpa split into simp only + exact where the
bridge term is defeq but not syntactic, convert-using-1 on IsRegular
replaced by exact, List.length_map instantiated by hand over the
def-wrapped InA/OutA, an instance with an explicit hypothesis demoted to a
lemma, simp only [] given its unfolding lemmas. No statement changed;
concepts untouched. Ledger entry in CAMPAIGN.md.
